continuing

We construct all of the (steady-state) solutions to the homogeneous Kuramoto
system for the 5-cycle. This includes all solutions, not just stable solutions.
In this example, we first construct the real solutions, and check their
(linear) stability. Then we find all complex solutions.  In this particular
example, all 30 solutions are real. We set the precision displayed to 3 digits.

