findRealSolutions -- find real solutions, at least one per component for well-conditioned systems
*************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        findRealSolutions I
        findRealSolutions G
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, an ideal in a polynomial ring
        over QQ or RR or CC.
      * G, a *note graph: (Graphs)Graph,, an undirected, connected graph $G$
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of all the real solutions that were
        found

Description
===========

In this package the main use is to zero in on equilibrium points for oscillator
systems associated to graphs.

