Caveat
======

If the system is positive dimensional, then of course it won't find all roots.
There might be real roots on a component, but none are found. If a component
(even a point) is singular, then it might have problems, depending on the
situation. In the latter case, there is a warning message emitted (about
non-regular solutions).

