oscQuadrics -- find the homogeneous quadrics in the homogeneous Kuramoto ideal
******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        oscQuadrics(G,R)
        oscQuadrics(G)
  * Inputs:
      * G, a *note graph: (Graphs)Graph,, an undirected, connected graph $G$ on
        vertices $0, \ldots, n-1$, where $n$ is the number of vertices of $G$
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, created with *note oscRing:
        oscRing,
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * Reduced => a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, default value
        false, if true, then the angles are reduced to the first angle being 0.
        That is, the number of oscillators will be one less than the number of
        vertices of $G$
  * Outputs:
      * an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, in the ring R

Description
===========

The ideal of quadrics of the oscillator system associated to the graph $G$.
This is the ideal generated by the quadrics of the system, where the system is
$d\theta_i/dt = \sum_j a_{ij} \sin(\theta_j - \theta_i)$ where we consider only
reduced equilibrium solutions $\theta_0 = 0$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = graph({0,1,2,3}, {{0,1},{1,2},{2,3},{0,3}})                         |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = Graph{0 => {1, 3}}                                                      |
|           1 => {0, 2}                                                       |
|           2 => {1, 3}                                                       |
|           3 => {0, 2}                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : Graph                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : oscRing(G, CoefficientRing => CC)                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = CC  [x ..x , y ..y ]                                                    |
|       53  0   3   0   3                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : S = oo                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = S                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : I = oscQuadrics(G,S)                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = ideal (x y  + x y  - x y  - x y , - x y  + x y  + x y  - x y , - x y  + |
|             1 0    3 0    0 1    0 3     1 0    0 1    2 1    1 2     2 1   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     x y  + x y  - x y , - x y  - x y  + x y  + x y )                        |
|      1 2    3 2    2 3     3 0    3 2    0 3    2 3                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Ideal of S                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : netList I_*                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|     +---------------------------+                                           |
|o5 = |x y  + x y  - x y  - x y   |                                           |
|     | 1 0    3 0    0 1    0 3  |                                           |
|     +---------------------------+                                           |
|     |- x y  + x y  + x y  - x y |                                           |
|     |   1 0    0 1    2 1    1 2|                                           |
|     +---------------------------+                                           |
|     |- x y  + x y  + x y  - x y |                                           |
|     |   2 1    1 2    3 2    2 3|                                           |
|     +---------------------------+                                           |
|     |- x y  - x y  + x y  + x y |                                           |
|     |   3 0    3 2    0 3    2 3|                                           |
|     +---------------------------+                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

