showExoticSolutions -- Display exotic solutions: linearly stable solutions which are not all-in-phase solution
**************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        showExoticSolutions G
        getExoticSolutions G
  * Inputs:
      * G, a *note graph: (Graphs)Graph,, An undirected, connected graph
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, A list of all of the linearly stable
        solutions for the Kuramoto oscillator system associated to the graph
  * Consequences:
      * The list of exotic solutions is displayed, together with the angles of
        the oscillators (where the first angle is always zero, and not
        displayed)

Description
===========

This function first calls *note getLinearlyStableSolutions:
getLinearlyStableSolutions,, and then displays any exotic solutions that exist.
A stable solution is exotic if it is not the all-in-phase solution (all the
angles are the same), and returns all of the stable solutions found.

Note: The methods getExoticSolutions and showExoticSolutions are the same, for
historical reasons.

The warning that there are non-regular solutions generally means that it has
come across a positive dimensional solution set while looking for solutions.
No such solutions can be linearly stable, so the warning is generally not
relevant.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = graph {{0,1},{1,2},{2,3},{3,4},{4,0}}                               |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = Graph{0 => {1, 4}}                                                      |
|           1 => {0, 2}                                                       |
|           2 => {1, 3}                                                       |
|           3 => {2, 4}                                                       |
|           4 => {0, 3}                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : Graph                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : showExoticSolutions G                                                   |
| -- .811456s elapsed                                                         |
